# Theming and Design Tokens

This rule defines the theming system and design token management.

## Theme System
- Light and dark mode support
- Custom theme creation capability
- Runtime theme switching
- CSS variable-based implementation
- Tailwind integration

## Design Tokens
### Colors
- Primary palette
- Secondary palette
- Semantic colors
- Status colors
- Gradient definitions
- Opacity values

### Typography
- Font families
- Font sizes
- Line heights
- Font weights
- Letter spacing
- Text transforms

### Spacing
- Grid system
- Margin scales
- Padding scales
- Gap values
- Layout spacing

### Other Tokens
- Border radii
- Shadow definitions
- Z-index scale
- Animation timing
- Breakpoints
- Container sizes

## Token Management
- JSON/YAML configuration
- Visual token editor
- Token documentation
- CSS variable mapping
- Theme inheritance
- Token versioning

## Implementation Guidelines
- Use CSS variables for runtime changes
- Implement proper fallbacks
- Follow semantic naming
- Maintain backwards compatibility
- Document token usage
- Provide migration paths
